        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "God Rejects Zedekiah's Request",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The word came to Jeremiah from the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.21.1",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.21.1"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "when King Zedekiah sent to him Pashhur son of Malkijah and the priest Zephaniah son of Maaseiah. They said:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Inquire now of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.21.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.21.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for us because Nebuchadnezzar",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "king of Babylon is attacking us. Perhaps the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.21.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.21.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "will perform wonders for us as in times past so that he will withdraw from us.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But Jeremiah answered them, \"Tell Zedekiah,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "'This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.21.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.21.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", the God of Israel, says: I am about to turn against you the weapons of war that are in your hands, which you are using to fight the king of Babylon and the Babylonians",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "who are outside the wall besieging you. And I will gather them inside this city.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I myself will fight against you with an outstretched hand and a mighty arm in furious anger and in great wrath.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will strike down those who live in this city—both man and beast—and they will die of a terrible plague.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "After that, declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.21.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.21.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", I will give Zedekiah king of Judah, his officials and the people in this city who survive the plague, sword and famine, into the hands of Nebuchadnezzar king of Babylon and to their enemies who want to kill them. He will put them to the sword; he will show them no mercy or pity or compassion.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Furthermore, tell the people, 'This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.21.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.21.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says: See, I am setting before you the way of life and the way of death.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Whoever stays in this city will die by the sword, famine or plague. But whoever goes out and surrenders to the Babylonians who are besieging you will live; they will escape with their lives.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have determined to do this city harm and not good, declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.21.10",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.21.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ". It will be given into the hands of the king of Babylon, and he will destroy it with fire.'",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "\"Moreover, say to the royal house of Judah, 'Hear the word of the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.21.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.21.11"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "This is what the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.21.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.21.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "says to you, house of David:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 21:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "\" 'Administer justice every morning;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 21:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "rescue from the hand of the oppressor",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 21:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "the one who has been robbed,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 21:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "or my wrath will break out and burn like fire",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 21:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "because of the evil you have done—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 21:12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "burn with no one to quench it.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I am against you, Jerusalem,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 21:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you who live above this valley",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 21:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "on the rocky plateau, declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.21.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.21.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "—",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 21:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "you who say, \"Who can come against us?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 21:13"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Who can enter our refuge?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JER 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I will punish you as your deeds deserve,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 21:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "declares the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Lord",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "JER.21.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "JER.21.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q1",
        "vid": "JER 21:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "I will kindle a fire in your forests",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "q2",
        "vid": "JER 21:14"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "that will consume everything around you.' \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JER.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JER.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
